<details class="setup-details steam-panel"><summary>Setup &amp; compatibility</summary><ol><li>Close Steam and run the installer.</li><li>Restart Steam and enable Custom Achievements in Millennium.</li><li>Open Custom Steam Achievements Setup to select game saves. Visit the game's library page once.</li></ol><p>Connect Steam cloud in plugin settings to sync progress. Ocarina and Pokopia support live tracking on Windows and Linux. Configure your game in Setup; Windows gameplay verification is still pending.</p><p>Desktop Steam only; no Flatpak, Snap or Decky. Custom achievements do not count toward official Steam profile totals.</p></details>
